sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Patient (portal)
    participant Auth as AuthService
    participant TG as TenantGuard
    participant PS as PatientScope
    participant Portal as PortalService
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService

    P->>Auth: POST /auth/login {orgId, email, password} with PATIENT role
    Auth->>DB: Load User + Patient link (Patient.userId)
    Auth->>PS: resolvePatientScope(link, roles)
    alt link exists AND role is PATIENT
        PS-->>Auth: patientId set
    else
        PS-->>Auth: null (no escalation)
    end
    Auth-->>P: Tokens if valid
    P->>TG: Request to portal endpoint
    TG->>TG: Set TenantScope.patientId from session/user link
    TG-->>Portal: Authorized
    Portal->>DB: Query with patientId filter (assertPatientOwnership)
    Portal->>Audit: audit patient_portal.access (as appropriate)
    Portal-->>P: Patient-scoped data only
    Note over PS: Both halves required; unique Patient.userId prevents cross-chart link
    Note over TG: Patient scope read from DB, not from client input
